{"unit_id":"hw-cola__dsh-remote-control#card-zh","repo":"hw-cola/dsh-remote-control","commit":"ef7142d270c06a4be9af317b13e62ef0ff4b1992","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh/remote-control 是一款面向 DSH Web 的远程访问插件，在设置面板增加“远程控制”页面。开启后，它启动 Node 代理并提供局域网地址和二维码，手机扫码即可打开 DSH Web 界面。页面支持切换本机局域网 IPv4 地址、查看已授权设备及移除设备；代理会处理普通 HTTP 请求和 WebSocket 连接，并为页面补充浏览器 UUID 能力。适合希望在同一局域网内用手机访问电脑上 DSH Web 的用户。需要本机安装 Node.js；已授权设备信息保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:323-347","lib/index.js:430-575","lib/client.js:270-318","lib/client.js:327-443"]}
{"unit_id":"hw-cola__dsh-remote-control#card-en","repo":"hw-cola/dsh-remote-control","commit":"ef7142d270c06a4be9af317b13e62ef0ff4b1992","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@dsh/remote-control adds a settings page to DSH Web. It starts a Node proxy and shows local IPv4 addresses and a QR code for phone access. Users can select an address, view registered devices, and remove them. Node.js is required; device records stay on the computer.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:323-347","lib/index.js:430-575","lib/client.js:270-318","lib/client.js:327-443"]}
